# Windows/WSL-friendly: force LF in the working tree on checkout, let git
# normalize on commit. The Windows workflow is documented in CONTRIBUTING.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending-normalized — the brand icons under
# custom_components/balcony_solar_forecast/brand/ ship to HACS as-is.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
